      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (West Side)                                                   Nos 44 and 44A TL 0507 1/162 II                       GV 2. C19 front to earlier structure.  Colour washed brick, roof parapet  2 storeys; lst floor 3 triple light sash windows, 2 with glazing bars, under stucco faced lintels and keyblocks, 1 canted bay window.  Included for group value. Nos 44, 44A and the Town Hall form a group. Listing NGR: TL0555407781"
